# Conformance probe pack for `with` (spec 0.18) on the `xml` wire. Public.
# No kinds.
#
#   @x                 x with y: an attribute written only when y is held
#   names/name #text   tag with val: a suppressed text item is an empty
#                      element (ruling 4, ruling 11 of 0.7)
format  conformance-cond-xml
version 0.18.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses    probe
wire    xml
root    msg
field   uid      @id    string
field   probe.x  @x     int  with probe.y
field   probe.y  a/@y   int
group   probe.names  names/name
  field probe.tag  "#text"  string  with probe.val
end
